WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.590 --> 00:00:05.580
So this October surprise published in The
New York Post last week about Joe Biden's

00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:10.460
son, Hunter Biden is, I'm calling it, on the
verge of, although some people say it already

00:00:10.460 --> 00:00:15.150
has spectacularly backfired on the Trump campaign.

00:00:15.150 --> 00:00:22.250
The entire story published last week was supposed
to make Joe Biden look really, really bad.

00:00:22.250 --> 00:00:27.529
It was supposed to prove that Joe Biden is
corrupt and a bad person and that so is his

00:00:27.529 --> 00:00:32.259
son, Hunter Biden, corrupt, terrible, bad
person and a drug addict.

00:00:32.259 --> 00:00:38.610
Not only has the story failed to hurt Joe
Biden so far, some of what is coming out as

00:00:38.610 --> 00:00:44.080
being Joe Biden's alleged text messages to
his son are actually just making him look

00:00:44.080 --> 00:00:47.170
like a good, kind, loving dad, an empathetic
person.

00:00:47.170 --> 00:00:49.489
And Republicans have no idea what to do.

00:00:49.489 --> 00:00:56.270
Now, before we even get into the specifics,
I want to let you know that we've since found

00:00:56.270 --> 00:01:03.350
out that the writer of this story, the primary
writer of the New York Post story, Bruce Golding,

00:01:03.350 --> 00:01:09.299
didn't even want his byline on the article
because he knew it lacked credibility.

00:01:09.299 --> 00:01:13.109
Many New York Post staffers we've since found
out, thanks to a great piece in The New York

00:01:13.109 --> 00:01:18.950
Times, New York Post staffers were saying
we shouldn't even be publishing this story.

00:01:18.950 --> 00:01:21.630
We don't even trust the reliability of the
sources.

00:01:21.630 --> 00:01:23.549
We questioned the timing.

00:01:23.549 --> 00:01:27.969
And we now know Rudy Giuliani was a big factor
in pushing for the story's publication.

00:01:27.969 --> 00:01:33.520
So no one, even internally, many at The New
York Post knew the story wouldn't shouldn't

00:01:33.520 --> 00:01:34.520
be published.

00:01:34.520 --> 00:01:35.520
But it was published.

00:01:35.520 --> 00:01:40.029
OK, first of all, the underlying premise of
all of this is that Joe Biden did things as

00:01:40.029 --> 00:01:45.189
vice president because Hunter Biden was on
the board of a Ukrainian energy company, including

00:01:45.189 --> 00:01:47.579
getting a prosecutor fired.

00:01:47.579 --> 00:01:53.639
That main story about Joe Biden getting a
prosecutor fired as as a gift to Hunter Biden

00:01:53.639 --> 00:01:55.999
has long been debunked.

00:01:55.999 --> 00:02:01.899
Even if you accept everything else in the
New York Post story is true, it does nothing

00:02:01.899 --> 00:02:02.899
to change that.

00:02:02.899 --> 00:02:05.520
The Biden prosecutor firing story is a lie.

00:02:05.520 --> 00:02:12.090
Joe Biden was involved in the Ukrainian situation
with the prosecutor at Barack Obama's direction.

00:02:12.090 --> 00:02:14.720
A coalition of countries was involved in that.

00:02:14.720 --> 00:02:19.150
The idea that Biden went and did it for Hunter
Biden because of his consulting contract,

00:02:19.150 --> 00:02:21.409
widely debunked already.

00:02:21.409 --> 00:02:24.579
Then some texts are published as part of this
story.

00:02:24.579 --> 00:02:28.750
Texts purported to be between Joe Biden and
Hunter Biden.

00:02:28.750 --> 00:02:35.579
What we learned from those texts are or is
that Joe Biden is a caring dad and talks to

00:02:35.579 --> 00:02:40.739
his son in a way that I've never even heard
of Donald Trump speaking to his children.

00:02:40.739 --> 00:02:45.680
He seems to love and and support his son,
Hunter Biden.

00:02:45.680 --> 00:02:48.129
It's clear Joe Biden loves his kids.

00:02:48.129 --> 00:02:52.959
Generally speaking, it's not super clear that
Trump does, at least not in the way that resembles

00:02:52.959 --> 00:02:54.510
healthy parenting.

00:02:54.510 --> 00:02:55.920
That helps Joe Biden.

00:02:55.920 --> 00:02:58.790
It makes Joe Biden look better.

00:02:58.790 --> 00:03:04.799
And in the text, you also see, again, if the
text Sariel, Joe Biden say, give me a call,

00:03:04.799 --> 00:03:07.970
because I am sure that my text messages are
a target.

00:03:07.970 --> 00:03:10.379
And indeed, Joe Biden was right about that.

00:03:10.379 --> 00:03:17.890
Now, thirdly, NBC News is reporting that federal
investigators are looking at whether the emails

00:03:17.890 --> 00:03:24.299
allegedly describing activities by Joe Biden
and Hunter Biden supposedly found on a laptop

00:03:24.299 --> 00:03:26.849
supposedly at a Delaware repair shop.

00:03:26.849 --> 00:03:31.489
Those emails are potentially linked to a foreign
intelligence operation.

00:03:31.489 --> 00:03:33.520
It's like it's happening again.

00:03:33.520 --> 00:03:41.389
Barry PSMA apparently was hacked by the same
Russian intelligence unit that was involved

00:03:41.389 --> 00:03:45.519
in the hacking of the Democratic National
Committee in 2016.

00:03:45.519 --> 00:03:47.080
It's happening again.

00:03:47.080 --> 00:03:49.440
That is now being investigated.

00:03:49.440 --> 00:03:54.590
The Washington Post also reported overnight
that U.S. intelligence agencies warned the

00:03:54.590 --> 00:04:00.739
White House last year that Trump's lawyer,
Rudy Giuliani, was the target of an influence

00:04:00.739 --> 00:04:04.129
operation by Russian intelligence.

00:04:04.129 --> 00:04:07.599
Rudy Giuliani has since admitted that it's
possible.

00:04:07.599 --> 00:04:09.849
I believe he said it's a 50/50 shot.

00:04:09.849 --> 00:04:14.150
It's possible that he was working with a Russian
spy on this story.

00:04:14.150 --> 00:04:15.469
Don't need to make any conspiracy.

00:04:15.469 --> 00:04:18.000
Just look at what Rudy himself himself said.

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:23.800
So far, it does not seem that this October
surprise has hurt Joe Biden at all.

00:04:23.800 --> 00:04:25.860
It may end up damaging Republicans.

00:04:25.860 --> 00:04:30.460
It may end up damaging Donald Trump's campaign
more than anything else for a second.

00:04:30.460 --> 00:04:32.850
Consider how absurd this all is.

00:04:32.850 --> 00:04:35.270
The Trump campaign is trying to smear.

00:04:35.270 --> 00:04:41.370
Joe Biden, by releasing the loving emails
and texts that he sent to his son.

00:04:41.370 --> 00:04:46.340
Guys, rumor has it Joe Biden cried when his
first wife and kid died.

00:04:46.340 --> 00:04:47.770
What a loser.

00:04:47.770 --> 00:04:52.210
That's the level of stuff that they are resorting
to and trying to pull off here.

00:04:52.210 --> 00:04:56.210
And really, I know that when Trump does his
rallies and talks about Hunter, the crowd

00:04:56.210 --> 00:04:58.720
boos and cheers and jeers and whatever.

00:04:58.720 --> 00:05:00.910
It doesn't seem to be.

00:05:00.910 --> 00:05:02.470
People don't seem to be falling for it.

00:05:02.470 --> 00:05:06.139
And what underlies this all to some degree.

00:05:06.139 --> 00:05:12.629
Think about it is that Republicans consider
empathy and kindness and sensitivity to be

00:05:12.629 --> 00:05:13.789
weaknesses.

00:05:13.789 --> 00:05:16.400
Trump certainly sees it that way for sure.

00:05:16.400 --> 00:05:18.620
This is why it doesn't make sense to argue
with them.

00:05:18.620 --> 00:05:20.759
They can't behave like normal humans.

00:05:20.759 --> 00:05:27.830
It could be a result of anger, fear, authoritarianism,
depending on which group you are talking about.

00:05:27.830 --> 00:05:30.150
But you can't reason with them.

00:05:30.150 --> 00:05:36.760
And as I read through the alleged texts between
Joe Biden and Hunter Biden, I like Biden more.

00:05:36.760 --> 00:05:42.610
The only really groundbreaking thing here
that came from this, suppose it October surprise,

00:05:42.610 --> 00:05:49.199
is that Rudy Giuliani is now being investigated
for potentially working with Russian spies.

00:05:49.199 --> 00:05:51.080
Maybe doesn't come as a huge shock to us.

00:05:51.080 --> 00:05:54.919
But so far, I know that there are some saying
there's much more coming and it's going to

00:05:54.919 --> 00:05:55.919
be much worse.

00:05:55.919 --> 00:05:57.710
Well, we've got 15 days to go.

00:05:57.710 --> 00:05:59.790
OK, so they'd better get it out soon.

00:05:59.790 --> 00:06:05.080
What is out so far does not strike me as even
remotely damaging to Joe Biden.

00:06:05.080 --> 00:06:10.580
Within a few days, we will have post New York
Post story polling and we'll be able to see

00:06:10.580 --> 00:06:11.580
for ourselves.

00:06:11.580 --> 00:06:16.120
We'll have more on this on our Instagram at
David Pakman show.

00:06:16.120 --> 00:06:21.449
And if you want to see me voting this weekend
powerfully voting, follow me on Instagram

00:06:21.449 --> 00:06:21.470
at David Pakman.

